WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.029 --> 00:00:03.680
MIKE MCMAHON: We
have a company based

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.820
in India that needed
the capability

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.100
to scale up to 32,000 cores.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.740
But they couldn't
do it in India.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.110
They had to move and do
it here in the States.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.620
And they leveraged GCP
here in the States.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.950
We provided the caching
layer for them to do that.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.260
We stood up and
ran 32,000 cores.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.190
And then a few weeks
later we ran another 32.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:27.950
So we ran 64,000 cores in a
very short period of time.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.560
That is powerful.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.332
We get into the
environments where,

00:00:31.332 --> 00:00:32.790
if it's a large
storage environment

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.780
and they need to leverage TCO
and the flexibility of moving

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:38.540
data into GCS, we can
do that on their behalf.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.820
So just that
flexibility is changing

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.240
the dynamics of the game.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.590
These are things that
couldn't be done before.

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:48.770
GCP is the only platform that
we see that has that capability

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.660
to scale that well, that fast.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.400
And we think we can
take it much larger.

